141
00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.300
But they're not under water the same way.

142
00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.830
So like, they're mostly above water.

143
00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.400
They're not getting a lot of-
But what would be

144
00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.280
the symptoms?

145
00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.530
Like what would you catch?

146
00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.710
I think ear infections would be the first thing.

147
00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.600
Ear infections, could be sinus infection.

148
00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.800
Diarrhea, dysentery.
It could be.

149
00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.040
If you like to drink seawater.

