153
00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:14.080
When I was living in New York City, right after college,

154
00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:18.230
like '89, '90, '91, my roommate, Matt Nats,

155
00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:22.090
