169
00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.440
You're going all the way around Manhattan.

170
00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.390
And he had to get all these shots.

171
00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.340
And then he told me that,

172
00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.060
especially up in the northern points,

173
