178
00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.850
And I also remember that near,

179
00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:24.240
sorta near the George Washington Bridge is this,

180
00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:25.680
I don't know if it's still there

181
00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:26.760
or if this is still a thing,

182
00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.850
but there was this giant like suck hole.

183
00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:33.600
Like there was something under the water that was like

184
00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.310
