194
00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.120
I could be wrong about that.
Yeah, that's the East River

195
00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.240
to Harlem River to Hudson, right?

196
00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.991
Isn't that the route or something like that?

197
00:07:56.991 --> 00:08:00.892
You start down near Wall Street.

198
00:08:00.892 --> 00:08:02.697
And I think you go up the East River first

199
00:08:02.697 --> 00:08:04.303
and you come down the Hudson.

200
00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:08.070
And he got second place.

201
00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:12.580
I think he, I think at the time, it was probably '90 or '91,

202
00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.320
he broke the men's record, but he got beat

203
00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:17.890
