204
00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.390
the queen, whose name escapes me,

205
00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.340
But she was like the queen of open-water swimming.

206
00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.970
Well, I mean, that was the triple crown, right,

207
00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:25.320
so for many years-
And his crew was comprised

208
00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:27.810
