209
00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.050
Whoever he could find.
Yeah. (laughs)

210
00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.760
Yeah, I need you to just hand me water every 30 minutes.

211
00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:34.080
Right, who had no idea what they were in for.

212
00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:37.330
And now I feel, I have tremendous regret

213
00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.210
