214
00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:43.720
But anyway, I don't know how we got off on that tangent.

215
00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:46.550
Open-water swimming.
Yeah, speaking of the rains.

216
00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:47.433
Yep.
I,

217
00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.470
in anticipation of it raining last night,

218
00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:53.670
I had to go and get a new tent, 'cause,

219
00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.770
which is something I have to do like every six months

220
00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:57.060
'cause the sun-
Really?

221
00:08:57.060 --> 00:09:00.200
Beats down on my cheap tent,

222
00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.460
and it becomes like tissue paper and it frays.

223
00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:04.421
So there were all these holes in mine.

224
00:09:04.421 --> 00:09:05.254
Oh my goodness.
it was like raining

