00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.960
Like this is not good.

238
00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.330
So the thought occurred to me,

239
00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.580
since I am sleeping in a tent basically every night,

240
00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:39.090
like, why am I spending four, $500

241
00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.800
