244
00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:49.030
So I've been researching.

245
00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:50.737
Like I could just get a huge tent

246
00:09:50.737 --> 00:09:53.030
and like create a whole room.

247
00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.605
So you're going from-
So now I'm excited

