00:31:30.213 --> 00:31:31.570
He was on treadmill sometimes.

786
00:31:31.570 --> 00:31:34.330
And then he was doing stair mat, he was doing a circuit.

787
00:31:34.330 --> 00:31:35.383
Right, got it.
Yeah.

788
00:31:36.951 --> 00:31:37.893
20 to 30,000 people.

