980
00:39:37.990 --> 00:39:41.310
And this is something that David does, Goggins does, right?

981
00:39:41.310 --> 00:39:44.200
It's like, there's David, and then there's Goggins.

982
00:39:44.200 --> 00:39:47.990
And he goes into Goggins when he does these things.

983
00:39:47.990 --> 00:39:52.450
Like, it's almost, it's not fair to call it a character,

984
00:39:52.450 --> 00:39:54.250
but it's something outside of the self

985
00:39:54.250 --> 00:39:58.210
that allows you to create like an arms length relationship

986
00:39:58.210 --> 00:40:01.580
with the feat that you're trying to accomplish,

987
00:40:01.580 --> 00:40:04.040
that I think is empowering and instructive

988
00:40:04.040 --> 00:40:08.530
in terms of how you, and it's not like somebody told David,

989
00:40:08.530 --> 00:40:11.343
create an alter ego for yourself or told James, create,

990
00:40:11.343 --> 00:40:13.320
it's like, these were just natural

991
00:40:13.320 --> 00:40:15.920
like survival tactics that they crafted

992
00:40:15.920 --> 00:40:19.540
in order to survive these difficult challenges.

993
00:40:19.540 --> 00:40:22.830
And I think it's cool, it's empowering as a means

994
00:40:22.830 --> 00:40:27.813
of helping you exceed your sense of personal limitations.

995
00:40:29.300 --> 00:40:33.490
So much love to James aka the Iron Cowboy.

